WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:04.690
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:04.691 --> 00:00:07.930
What do they see?

3
00:00:07.931 --> 00:00:15.850
They see masks, fins, and tanks.

4
00:00:15.851 --> 00:00:20.157
It's time to scuba dive.

5
00:00:20.158 --> 00:00:25.047
The blobs dive into the sea.

6
00:00:25.048 --> 00:00:45.461
They swim with jellyfish.

7
00:00:45.462 --> 00:01:08.431
They swim with stingrays.

8
00:01:08.432 --> 00:01:29.347
They swim with clownfish.

9
00:01:29.348 --> 00:01:58.226
They swim with octopuses.

10
00:01:58.227 --> 00:02:22.631
They swim with dolphins.

11
00:02:22.632 --> 00:02:40.274
Whoa! They swim with a huge whale!

12
00:02:40.275 --> 00:02:46.112
The whale gives them a ride.

13
00:02:46.113 --> 00:02:49.022
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:49.023 --> 00:02:52.155
Good-bye!

